# Scene files are text by default (docs/SCENES.md): `Scene.save` and the editor
# write the text view, so they diff and merge like source. A scene converted
# to binary (`cuervo-tools scene migrate <dir> --binary`) still diffs as text
# once the textconv driver is configured:
#   git config diff.scene.textconv "build/debug/tools/cuervo_tools/cuervo-tools scene dump"
# Merging is the default line-based 3-way merge; see docs/SCENES.md "Merging".
*.scene text eol=lf diff=scene
* text=auto eol=lf
